## Attribution (this license does not cover the pedagogy)

teacher-sab is a fork of [amosblomqvist/learn](https://github.com/amosblomqvist/learn).
The teaching pedagogy inside `skills/` — the two teaching principles, the
probe → plan → teach loop, the quiz construction rules, and the visualization
discipline — was written by the original owner of that project, which ships
without a license of its own. This MIT grant covers **this fork's work only**:
the installer (`setup.sh`, `bin/`), the packaging shape, and the improvements
documented in [IMPROVEMENTS.md](IMPROVEMENTS.md).

If you distribute or teach the pedagogy itself, credit amosblomqvist/learn,
not this fork's MIT license.